WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
Left: pass without a position; cash stays available.

2
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:07.000
Right: review quantity, cost, cash and risk before confirmation.

3
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.500
Up: save a reason to revisit; watching is not buying.

4
00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:14.000
Down: edit the quantity and see the cost change before a fill.

5
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Choose a practice comfort zone.

6
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Pass, watch, or open a separate paper review.

7
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Historical context carries a date. It is not a forecast.

8
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Move an assumed expiry price. See the hypothetical payoff; the premium can be lost.

9
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Leadership. Promises versus results. Public sentiment.

10
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Sources and dates stay visible. Opinion is not consensus.

11
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Question recorded. Retrieval, model and checks not run. Trace not sent.

12
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Historical evidence is separate from this request and the current game.

13
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:49.000
Compare risk profiles, then compare current, hypothetical and fictional allocations.

14
00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.000
Review the paper impact, acknowledge the risk, then confirm. Read the resulting receipt.

15
00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:57.000
Simulated agent review: $250 gross less $2 example fee, then a $248 paper purchase. No wallet connected.

16
00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:01.000
Manual entry: review a paper order, or save a separately labeled existing-trade record.

17
00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:03.000
Alternative gain scenario: +10%, not a forecast.

18
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:05.000
Alternative loss scenario: −10%, not a forecast.

19
00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:07.000
Alternative flat scenario: 0% holding P&L, conversion fee separate.

20
00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Saved holdings and the thesis survive reopening.

21
00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:13.000
Your confirmed profile and completed setup persist.

22
00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:17.000
Bloom public positioning beside Apollo’s evidenced paper-learning flow.

23
00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:21.000
Invstr public positioning beside Apollo’s evidenced paper-learning flow.

24
00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:25.000
Finimize public positioning beside Apollo’s evidenced paper-learning flow.

